# benchmark.py run outputs -- regenerate by running the script; not the
# real served baselines (those are the allow-listed telecom_*.json above).
# The two committed ones are the runs the README quotes. models/results/ is NOT
# ignored: every result file there is the output a README number comes from,
# committed on purpose (it used to be ignored while 41 of its files were tracked).
models/baselines_*.json
!models/baselines_smd_multi.json
!models/baselines_telecom_fleet.json
